[MEMORY - WORK MEETING - PARTIAL RECONSTRUCTION]

Conference room B. Fluorescent lights humming.

Dr. Reeves was presenting the quarterly results.
Something about "efficiency metrics" and "processing
throughput." I wasn't really listening.

I kept thinking about what I saw in Patient 847's
file last week. The things they asked me to remove.

"Sarah? Sarah, are you with us?"

"Yes, sorry. I was just... processing."

Everyone laughed. I smiled.
My face hurt from smiling.